      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Key Ayurvedic Herbs"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Ashwagandha: Helps reduce stress and anxiety, which are major triggers for high blood pressure."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Arjuna: Strengthens cardiac muscles and reduces plaque buildup in blood vessels."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Garlic (Lasuna): Consuming a raw clove in the morning helps lower blood pressure and cholesterol."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Jatamansi: Acts as an antioxidant and protects arteries from free radical damage."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Amla: Rich in Vitamin C, it helps keep blood pressure in check and supports overall heart health."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Lifestyle and Dietary Tips"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Increase Potassium: Drink coconut water and eat potassium-rich foods like bananas to counteract sodium."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Manage Stress: Practice yoga, meditation, and deep-breathing exercises (Pranayama) daily."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Limit Salt: Reduce sodium intake and avoid heavily processed or fried foods."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "To help me provide more tailored guidance, could you tell me:"
      },
